   "body": "Merged in #958 (as e8c9e31edd5afd2f1532d88b6a694b3a7c5da1f0): the landing test waits for its first report, and `scrollPage(toScrollY:)` resends until the page and the scroll view agree. #934 stays open until mac/M1 reports 20 consecutive green runs of the reader web suites (acceptance criterion). The page-end `scrollTo` loss of job 133090341114 is still unexplained.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
